  "title": "Old-Fashioned Potato Soup",
  "description": "This old-fashioned potato soup recipe is easy to make with tender potatoes, onions, butter, and milk for a creamy, comforting, and versatile soup.",
  "authors": [
    "Cyd Lmbros"
  ],
