  "ingredients": [
    "0.25 cup butter",
    "1 large onion, chopped",
    "6 potatoes, peeled and diced",
    "2 carrots, diced",
    "3 cups water",
    "2 tablespoons chicken bouillon powder",
    "ground black pepper to taste",
    "3 tablespoons all-purpose flour",
    "3 cups milk",
    "1 tablespoon dried parsley",
    "0.25 teaspoon dried thyme"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7QH7CCyooMk3-1Vjm3brNJI4Mno=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13043-old-fashioned-potato-soup-DDMFS-006-4x3-step-01-15f0986d21784bd7b980e74a4f82e146.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13043/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt butter in a saucepan over medium heat. Stir in onion; cook and stir until onion has softened and turned translucent, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/PWT1vwBtq-gdvLvdNC--NgRjRXk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13043-old-fashioned-potato-soup-DDMFS-009-4x3-step-02-f309baab6a774f84988ff66cacda32f2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13043/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "While onions are cooking, place diced potatoes, carrots, water, and chicken bouillon in another pot and bring to a boil. Cook until vegetables are tender, about 10 minutes. Do not overcook. Season with ground black pepper to taste.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/zIfFT13_SuKelvyYOtCbRoDYJQ8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13043-old-fashioned-potato-soup-DDMFS-014-4x3-step-03-ea3b7a3eb81b484f958dbbc837e425e6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13043/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add flour to cooked onions to make a paste. Cook, stirring constantly, for 2 minutes. Gradually add milk and stir well. Cook over low heat stirring constantly until warmed through.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Wvk5zq0Y7kfRA67YbXIWE7QbzjE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13043-old-fashioned-potato-soup-DDMFS-015-4x3-step-04-a44f7c857e7348f5bb151c47eada5a34.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13043/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add potato and carrot mixture. Stir in parsley and thyme and heat through. Serve hot.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/GCIsmSey7l5lbLfsrP60c0zCc78=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13043-old-fashioned-potato-soup-DDMFS-016-4x3-step-05-08990051fa004337a4cf2cf9857a4359.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13043/step_05.webp"
    }
  ],
